        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ellesmere Port Town F.C., Ford Motors F.C., West Cheshire Association Football League\n- Places: Cheshire, Dunkirk Lane\n- Concepts: English football leagues, sponsorship, FA Vase\n\nFacts:\n- The West Cheshire Association Football League, commonly known as the West Cheshire League, is an English football league in the county of Cheshire.\n- Carlsberg is the current principal sponsor of the West Cheshire Association Football League and also sponsors the South West Peninsula League.\n- Ford Motors F.C. reached the fourth round of the FA Vase in 1985.\n- Ford Motors F.C. compete in the West Cheshire Association Football League.\n- Ellesmere Port Town F.C. are currently members of West Cheshire League Division Two.\n- Ellesmere Port Town F.C. play at Dunkirk Lane.",
